# Global Context (Rules Only)

This file defines non-negotiable rules that apply to all code generated in this repository.

---

## Architecture
- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript (strict mode)
- Server Components by default
- Client Components only when browser APIs or interactivity are required

---

## Multi-Tenancy (CRITICAL)
- Every database read/write MUST filter by tenant_id
- Tenant context must never be inferred implicitly
- Tenant isolation overrides all other concerns

---

## Security
- Validate all inputs at system boundaries
- Never trust client-provided identifiers
- Authorization checks are mandatory for all mutations